{
  "message": "“Sprint 2” reports a second island and reef damage toward the slice, but no accessible build verifies either. Without that build or five-player findings, the goal remains at risk halfway through. Make this the last route change: defer co-op, drop the trailer storyboard, and share a one-island boat-and-tide build within the remaining 20–30 confirmed hours. Next sprint, I look forward to your build, player findings and devlog posts ;).",
  "agreed": [
    {
      "text": "Drop the trailer storyboard and defer co-op to leave time for a tested boat-and-tide prototype.",
      "itemId": "cmvtkfvux08tcnxz8u08axfq7",
      "dueDay": null
    },
    {
      "text": "Share a downloadable Godot build with one island, a short sailing route, a working tide cycle and launch instructions.",
      "itemId": null,
      "dueDay": null
    },
    {
      "text": "Test the build with five players. Publish findings on sailing, tide readability and problems that stopped play.",
      "itemId": null,
      "dueDay": null
    }
  ]
}

